---
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Marcus David Yang · Aerospace Engineering Portfolio</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Aerospace engineering portfolio of Marcus David Yang — CFD simulation, thrust-vector-control rocketry, and flight hardware design." />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div id="wrapper">
      <nav>
        <span class="nav-name">
          Marcus David Yang | Aerospace Engineer @ UIUC
        </span>

        <div class="nav-links">
          <a href="#projects">projects</a>
          <a href="#about">about</a>
          <a href="/resume.pdf" class="resume-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">resume ↓</a>
        </div>
      </nav>

      <section class="hero">
        <p class="hero-label">Aerospace Engineering</p>
        <h1>Engineering, from<br />simulation to hardware.</h1>
        <p class="hero-desc">
          A running set of projects in propulsion, controls, and simulation —
          ordered by what best represents the work, not by when it happened.
          Some are finished, some are still in progress.
        </p>
      </section>

      <p class="section-label" id="projects">Projects</p>
      <div class="projects">
        <a href="/projects/tvc-rocket" class="project-card-link">
          <div class="project-card">
            <span class="badge-progress">in progress</span>
            <h3>Thrust Vector Control Rocket</h3>
            <p>
              A 4" model rocket with an active two-axis gimbaled thrust-vector-control
              system, working toward a hobbyist-scale propulsive vertical landing.
            </p>
            <div class="skill-tags">
              <span class="skill-tag">Python</span>
              <span class="skill-tag">PID Control</span>
              <span class="skill-tag">Monte Carlo Simulation</span>
              <span class="skill-tag">Siemens NX</span>
              <span class="skill-tag">Embedded (Teensy 4.1)</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/projects/de-laval-nozzle" class="project-card-link">
          <div class="project-card">
            <h3>CFD Analysis of a de Laval Nozzle</h3>
            <p>
              Designed, meshed, and simulated compressible flow through a
              converging-diverging nozzle to characterize supersonic expansion.
            </p>
            <div class="skill-tags">
              <span class="skill-tag">Siemens NX</span>
              <span class="skill-tag">SpaceClaim</span>
              <span class="skill-tag">ANSYS Meshing</span>
              <span class="skill-tag">ANSYS Fluent</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/projects/projects-site" class="project-card-link">
          <div class="project-card">
            <h3>This Portfolio Site</h3>
            <p>
              This site itself — a small Astro build meant to stay fast, easy
              to extend, and simple to keep current as projects change.
            </p>
            <div class="skill-tags">
              <span class="skill-tag">Astro</span>
              <span class="skill-tag">CSS</span>
              <span class="skill-tag">Vercel</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="section-label" id="about">About</p>
      <div class="about">
        <p>
          I'm an aerospace engineering student at the University of Illinois
          Urbana-Champaign, interested in propulsion, guidance and control,
          and the simulation work that de-risks hardware before it gets
          built. Coursework in fluid dynamics and controls shows up directly
          in these projects — the CFD nozzle analysis and the rocket's PID
          gimbal control loop both grew out of class material I wanted to
          take further on my own.
        </p>
        <p>
          Current focus is closed-loop flight control: taking the TVC rocket
          from simulation through built hardware and toward a first flight.
        </p>
        <div class="contact-links">
          <a href="mailto:marcusdyang@gmail.com">email</a>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/marcusdyang" target="_blank" rel="noopener">linkedin ↗</a>
          <a href="https://github.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github ↗</a>
          <a href="/resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">resume ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <footer>
        <p>Marcus David Yang</p>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/marcusdyang" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn ↗</a>
        <a href="https://github.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github ↗</a>
      </footer>
    </div>

    <style>
      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

      body {
        font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
        background: #fafaf9;
        color: #1a1a18;
      }

      #wrapper {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 860px;
        margin-left: auto;
        margin-right: auto;
        padding-left: 80px;
        padding-right: 80px;
      }

      nav {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        padding-top: 2.5rem;
        padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e0dfd8;
        margin-bottom: 4rem;
      }

      .nav-name {
        font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 2rem;
      }

      .nav-links a {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #888780;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .nav-links a:hover { color: #1a1a18; }

      .resume-link {
        font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #1a1a18 !important;
        border: 1px solid #d3d1c7;
        border-radius: 100px;
        padding: 6px 14px;
      }

      .resume-link:hover {
        background: #f1efea;
      }

      .hero {
        margin-bottom: 5rem;
      }

      .hero-label {
        font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #b4b2a9;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
        font-size: 44px;
        font-weight: 400;
        line-height: 1.15;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }

      .hero-desc {
        font-size: 16px;
        color: #5f5e5a;
        line-height: 1.7;
        max-width: 480px;
      }

      .section-label {
        font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 11px;
        color: #b4b2a9;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      }

      .projects {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
        gap: 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 5rem;
      }

      .project-card-link {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: inherit;
        display: block;
        height: 100%;
      }

      .project-card {
        background: #fafaf9;
        padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
        height: 100%;
        border: 1px solid #e0dfd8;
        border-radius: 12px;
        box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(26, 26, 24, 0.04);
        transition: border-color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease;
      }

      .project-card:hover {
        background: #f1efea;
        border-color: #d3d1c7;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(26, 26, 24, 0.06);
      }

      .badge-progress {
        display: inline-block;
        font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 10px;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        padding: 3px 8px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
        background: #FBEFD8;
        color: #92600B;
      }

      .project-card h3 {
        font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
        font-size: 19px;
        font-weight: 400;
        line-height: 1.3;
        margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
      }

      .project-card p {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #5f5e5a;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .skill-tags {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 6px;
        margin-top: 1rem;
      }

      .skill-tag {
        font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 10px;
        color: #888780;
        border: 1px solid #d3d1c7;
        border-radius: 100px;
        padding: 3px 9px;
      }

      .about {
        max-width: 560px;
        margin-bottom: 5rem;
      }

      .about p {
        font-size: 15px;
        color: #5f5e5a;
        line-height: 1.75;
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      }

      .contact-links {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 1.5rem;
        margin-top: 1.75rem;
      }

      .contact-links a {
        font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #1a1a18;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #d3d1c7;
        padding-bottom: 2px;
      }

      .contact-links a:hover { color: #5f5e5a; }

      footer {
        padding-top: 2rem;
        padding-bottom: 3rem;
        border-top: 1px solid #e0dfd8;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
      }

      footer p {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #b4b2a9;
        font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      }

      footer a {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #b4b2a9;
        font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      footer a:hover { color: #1a1a18; }

      @media (max-width: 640px) {
        #wrapper {
          padding-left: 24px;
          padding-right: 24px;
        }
        .projects {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
